sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task, decision swamp-vault-secrets (step output to a vault key), F9 import read rule; DECISIONS round 2 (env_import via vault key env-import-<operation_id>, no callback, overwrite with empty value).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as app-dev Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: env:import<br/>{instance: 42, replace: false}
  Note over GW: Check owner, lock env<br/>task #5130 · instance.env_import
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-instance-env-import
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>operation #5130
  SW->>N: Read .env, at most 1 MiB<br/>@swamp/ssh · no symlink, no change
  N-->>SW: raw bytes, owner, mode
  Note over SW: Put bytes in the vault<br/>vault key env-import-5130
  alt file read and stored
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>outputs: key names, size, sha256
    GW->>SW: Read the vault key once<br/>env-import-5130
    Note over GW: Check sha256, store values<br/>then overwrite key with empty
  else missing or unreadable
    N--xSW: env.import_source_missing
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code, no values
    Note over GW: Store nothing<br/>task → failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5130
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
